UBERON:0002471 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "zeugopod" ;
    IAO:0000115 "The middle free limb segment, between the autopod and stylopod segments. Includes as parts the zeugopodial skeleton. Examples: There are two types of zeugopod: forelimb zeugopod (aka forearm), hindlimb zeugopod (aka crus)." ;
